          "short": "$\\frac45$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{n-m}{5}&=\\frac{20-16}{5}\\\\\\frac{n-m}{5}&=\\frac45\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
        "id": "p11-q5-e",
