          "short": "$14$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{m}{4}+10&=\\frac{16}{4}+10\\\\\\frac{m}{4}+10&=4+10\\\\\\frac{m}{4}+10&=14\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 31
